1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,740
Something is
sending me messages.

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:03,580
In neon.

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,250
Not me. I only do insults.

4
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:05,890
I'm Mara.

5
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:07,320
I fix signs, at night.

6
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:08,030
That's Zip.

7
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:09,180
He complains.

8
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,320
I supervise.

9
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:13,030
Tonight's job was
left on the step.

10
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:13,580
No name.

11
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,430
No note.

12
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:17,240
Just my mother's mark,
scratched on the back.

13
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:19,520
Mara, she's been
gone nine years.

14
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:21,430
I know how long it's been.

15
00:00:21,930 --> 00:00:23,380
So I woke it up.

16
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:25,930
It says hello! It's friendly.

17
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:26,690
I love it.

18
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,540
That is not hello.

19
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,400
Help. Zip, pull the plug.

20
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,920
It was never plugged in.

21
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,280
Then it lit one more word.

22
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:35,400
Tomorrow, what?

23
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,700
Finish your sentence!

24
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,010
And outside, a sign I
never made switched on.

25
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:41,970
It had my name.

26
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:44,810
And someone was
waiting under it.
